### 음식 이미지 업로드 presigned-url 생성 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals/images/presigned-url
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileSizeBytes": 1000
}

### 발급받은 presigned url로 이미지 S3에 업로드
PUT https://nyummy-app-bucket-455615001241-ap-northeast-2-an.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/temp/a707997e-3b87-4fe8-affc-5fa01f67fd78.jpg?
