### 식사기록 생성 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


{
  "name": "crazy_spicy",
  "imageKey": "temp/a707997e-3b87-4fe8-affc-5fa01f67fd78.jpg",
  "mealAt": "2026-07-20T07:12:26Z",
  "iconId": 1
}

### 분석 상태 조회 API
@mealId = 11
GET {{url}}/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 재분석 요청 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}